"New Code" = "新配对码";
"No network" = "未联网";
"Pairing is mutual: when the other device enters this Mac's code — or this Mac enters the other's — both see each other's usage. Only hourly totals are shared, over an encrypted connection." = "配对是双向的：另一台设备输入本机的配对码，或本机输入对方的配对码，完成后两台设备都能看到彼此的用量。仅共享按小时汇总的数据，且通过加密连接传输。";
"Devices That Can See This Mac" = "可查看本机的设备";
"Last read %@" = "最近读取：%@";
"Paired %@, not read yet" = "%@配对，尚未读取";
"Revoke" = "撤销";
"Its next request is refused; it has to pair again" = "它的下一次请求将被拒绝，需要重新配对";
"That device no longer has access." = "该设备已无访问权限。";
"No paired devices yet. Turn on sharing on either device to get a pairing code, then enter it on the other one — pairing works both ways." = "尚未配对任何设备。在任一设备上开启共享以获得配对码，再在另一台设备上输入——配对是双向的。";
"Finds devices that are sharing, over Bonjour and by checking this Mac's own network. Not listed? Guest Wi-Fi, VLANs and client isolation block it — add the device by its address instead, e.g. 192.168.1.20:4319." = "通过 Bonjour 并检查本机所在网段来查找正在共享的设备。没有列出？访客 Wi-Fi、VLAN 和客户端隔离会阻止查找——请改用地址添加设备，例如 192.168.1.20:4319。";
"On the other device, turn on sharing. It shows a six-digit code that is valid for two minutes and works once. Pairing is mutual: afterwards both devices see each other's usage, and this Mac starts sharing too." = "在另一台设备上开启共享，它会显示一个 6 位配对码，2 分钟内有效且只能使用一次。配对是双向的：完成后两台设备都能看到彼此的用量，本机也会开始共享。";
"By Device · Cost" = "按设备 · 费用";
"By Device · Tokens" = "按设备 · Tokens";
"Starting sharing…" = "正在开启共享…";
"Port 4319 is in use — another copy of GlobalTokenTracker may be sharing on this Mac. Retrying…" = "端口 4319 被占用——本机可能有另一个 GlobalTokenTracker 正在共享。正在重试…";

